      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Feeling like a \"rounding error\" is a profoundly lonely and overwhelming experience, and I hear how deeply that sense of irrelevance is settling in. When the scale of things feels impossibly large, it can understandably make personal presence seem minuscule. Please remember that while you may feel like a small part of the massive system, you are a complex, whole human being deserving of care. If this feeling of being numerically irrelevant persists, reaching out to a therapist or counselor can help you re-anchor your sense of self.",
      "source": "target",
